+ * Program SYS1CLK_1US with the core clock frequency in cycles per microsecond.
+ * Writing this register is mandatory from UFS HCI v4.0.0 on (the controller
+ * runs its internal timers from it); Linux does it in ufs_qcom_cfg_timers()
+ * before link startup, U-Boot never wrote it at all.
